step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Evaluate a simple mean over the full model pool to establish a baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination with inverse_error on the full pool to see if weighting improves over the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a median combination on the full pool to see if a robust central tendency improves over weighted mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if trimming the extremes improves over median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error combination on the smaller pool1 to see if focusing on the top models improves SMAPE.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a median combination on the smaller, high‑performing pool1 to see if focusing on the top models improves SMAPE over the full‑pool median.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a simple mean on the smaller pool1 to see if reducing model set improves SMAPE.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a dynamic Bayesian aggregation (dba) on the smaller, high‑performing pool1 to see if it can improve over the median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool using softmax_neg_error to see if a different weighting scheme improves over median.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error combination on pool2 to see if adding one more high‑performing model improves over the median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a median combination on pool2 to see if reducing the pool to the best 7 models improves over the current median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error combination on the full pool to see if focusing on the top models improves over the median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool using a feature‑based weight scheme to see if model relevance can improve SMAPE over the median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"feature_based"}

